Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:05.22,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Alomagedon is no more!{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:09.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Angels and demons divide heaven and earth.{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:13.27,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You shall be cursed for all eternity!{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:14.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero derosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.12,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.74,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:24.59,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:25.76,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,A-Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:30.93,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's got her in such a huffy puffy mood-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:37.60,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,She made this okonomiyaki for you, Mikan-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Okonomiyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:40.86,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:49.12,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Aloma did her best to grill this okonomiyaki since you were that hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:51.26,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:52.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guess I'll have to.{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:59.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall procure the corpse of a swine wrapped in white skin for thee.{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:02.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for getting a pork bun!{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:04.40,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait there, I'll be back momentarily.{EP47}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.26,0:01:07.87,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,For Mikan's sake, Aloma...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:12.81,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan was so hungry she couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.81,0:01:18.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,In any case, Aloma's upset because you ate the cake SoLaMi Smile made!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:19.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:24.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You see, Mikan-chan made that cake for Aloma-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:24.90,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.57,0:01:28.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma, Mikan's sorry-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:32.83,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma... sorry-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.29,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:38.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Since Aloma saw the preparations for her surprise party,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:41.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,we couldn't tell her the truth-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:43.33,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:45.66,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:51.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma grilled Mikan such a delicious okonomiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:53.98,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan needs to tell Aloma she's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:59.60,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,And in order to do that, she must find the pages that went flying off earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.59,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.59,0:02:03.38,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.59,0:02:03.38,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Wa{\fscx300}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:05.07,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:39.99,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,June 6th, Idol Breakup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:45.26,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's not here-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.82,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I rushed over after hearing what happened-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.62,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,But we haven't found anything yet-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.54,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Any luck over there-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:54.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where did they fly off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:58.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:03:59.39,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's a given.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:01.66,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Besides, if Alomagedon breaks up now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:05.07,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Dressing Parfedon, the name we came up with, won't become a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:06.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll definitely find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:08.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You know that's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.07,0:04:11.23,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You're helping them because you're worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:13.15,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.62,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:16.98,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:18.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sophie-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:21.83,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that those pages...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:23.04,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...are very precious to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:33.51,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That picture is our promise to become Divine Idols together when we were younger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:39.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Without it, Alomagedon might really be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's do everything we can to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.81,0:04:44.13,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:48.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All right, let's get searching!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:50.22,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.95,Default,All,0,0,0,,We can't find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:59.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's pointless to look around aimlessly-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:02.77,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,By taking into consideration the gust of wind from back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:03.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,the rate of descent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:08.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,and by calculating the drag of a piece of paper,\N I can narrow down the list of possible locations-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's our Mirelle for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.13,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,All right, I've got it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:17.84,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It could be anywhere in PriPara-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:21.36,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Attention idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:23.31,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara will be closing shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.31,0:05:26.27,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,PriPara Town is quite big-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.27,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You're asking the impossible-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We haven't found it after searching this long...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:34.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We'll have to search all of PriPara on our hands and knees-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:38.99,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.24,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:42.51,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:54.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:57.26,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Got it-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.22,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Wow! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:02.18,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,But the other half...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.83,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to be in the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.97,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,so please do not enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:12.55,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,Girls, it's already time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:14.58,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,Please make your way home straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.22,Default,Meganee,0,0,0,,This was the system speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.29,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Kurosu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:30.32,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Hey, get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.40,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,It's dangerous up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.75,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Hey, Kurosu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:35.69,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.69,0:06:37.21,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:40.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The time hath come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:44.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Angels and demons shall divide heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:49.68,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Let blood be bathed in blood as the flames of war are ignited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Earth has only one path left to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.87,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,A path to destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:57.75,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.11,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:01.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan's sorry-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.82,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan wants to talk with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:08.95,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You see, Mikan really, really, really loves you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:13.17,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The sun has set, and it shall never shine again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.03,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It was all Mikan's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:17.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She's really sorry-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:20.84,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,A demon's rage shall last for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.73,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Lightning, flash! Tempest, howl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:28.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Punish the angel's sins for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.53,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,It's clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.23,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wait up, Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:37.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Listen to what Mikan has to say-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:38.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I have no reason to speak to thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,If thine plan is to make merry with SoLaMi Smile without me{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.75,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That cake was for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:45.90,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,I can't hear thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:47.74,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:51.39,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ge...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:52.91,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:53.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.67,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Please listen to the angel's request-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:01.12,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:03.34,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou are nothing but an audacious angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.54,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wait-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:06.25,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Please-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:06.25,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:13.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan has thought it over and has stopped eating so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:17.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,So Mikan is out of energy because she's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:24.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It seems words aren't enough to get through to Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.93,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Tada!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:45.84,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That's a delicious-looking sponge cake you baked there-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:51.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It smells angelic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:53.72,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You're drooling-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:56.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is for Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:58.41,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,But it still smells delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:01.18,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Look at this and return to your senses-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:02.03,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,No! Mikan can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Eating it is strictly off the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:08.81,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,By sincerely remaking it, Mikan will present Aloma with the best birthday cake ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.81,0:09:10.21,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That's the spirit-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.83,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You can do it-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:18.79,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Hey, Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What is it? I have no use for thee any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:21.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:23.25,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Hold it-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:27.22,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,There are proper steps to take if you really want to disband Alomagedon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:29.68,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.94,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Still can't find it-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:42.31,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Well, I also lost something around here about six months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.19,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,and I still haven't found it-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:47.04,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Oh... They're not listening, huh-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:49.46,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hope you find it soon-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:53.16,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And if you do, Alomagedon might be willing to team up with you-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:57.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Making sure they make up is more important than forming a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:58.62,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:03.59,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We've been searching for so long, and we still haven't found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.10,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:12.43,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hold it right there-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:13.41,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What are you eating-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:15.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Out with it! Out with it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.85,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Lala, shove your hand down its throat and get it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:19.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:20.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:21.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.53,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hurry up-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.53,0:10:25.78,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:27.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Search everywhere-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:30.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ca{\alpha&HFF&}pisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:31.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capi{\alpha&HFF&}sce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisc{\alpha&HFF&}e!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:33.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:35.17,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:35.17,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's out-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:35.83,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:37.79,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:41.15,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,...the PR pic I lost six months ago-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You found it for me-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.34,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Not even worth looking at-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.34,0:10:47.56,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's just put it back-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:49.97,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ah! You're horrible-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:54.67,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:56.60,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:10:57.89,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:01.90,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The butterfly's fluttering about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:05.28,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We don't have time to be so easygoing-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:10.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a really big butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:18.58,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan won't eat it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:25.45,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}This twisted shape is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:29.71,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not good, all this cream is trying to seduce Mikan-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.35,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eat it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:33.22,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}If thou eat it, thou will feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The devil's temptation at a time like this-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:37.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:38.41,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,No! Don't give in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:40.47,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Angels are supposed to be infallible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:41.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan's an angel-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:43.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This cake's for Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:47.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This cake's for Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.18,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,A goat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hey, let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.24,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:58.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Something came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:03.47,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A piece of paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:05.33,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Could it be the drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:10.75,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh, you're earlier than I expected-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:14.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I want to get the disbanding over and done with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:17.77,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I like {marine produce}Sanddab more than disband-nekon.{fuck this word sounding similar pun shit!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:18.73,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:22.41,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,As part of the process, please take a look at this-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.27,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hooray! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:32.83,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Time to ea...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:34.40,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,No! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is an important cake-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:39.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't eat it-gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.59,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.49,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That's your cake, Aloma-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.85,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Did you forget-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:47.21,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Today is your birthday-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.89,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,She was trying to make that cake yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,and then Lala and Sophie came-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:56.55,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,They want to form a Dream Team together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile did?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:01.51,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,So they offered to help make your cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:05.48,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,But then, you see, Mikan ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:05.48,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:08.67,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is for Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.94,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma, Mikan is sorry-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:20.32,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Oh! Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:22.53,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You came-nano?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:28.51,Default,All,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:36.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is your surprise cake-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:40.59,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,All of this caused such a big misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:42.93,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan is really sorry-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:48.45,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You know how you're always bringing Mikan delicious food?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:52.56,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Well, Mikan wanted to make this delicious cake to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:57.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Even the okonomiyaki you made yesterday was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.52,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{You mean }Thou actually ate it?{ the okonomiyaki?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:02.63,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,How foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:06.50,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I can't believe thee ate it after eating that much cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:09.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Of course! I wouldn't leave even a crumb.{a bit liberal - more like I would eat it all without leaving anything}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:13.79,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou really... ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:18.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,From now on Mikan will only eat whatever you bring her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.42,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:25.06,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I-It's okay... to eat what others bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:28.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,After all, I can't always be with thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:31.93,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for acting so childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:34.62,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma, thank you-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:37.67,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The food I get from you is always the most delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.31,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I get it! I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:42.78,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll curse thee for all eternity for saying such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,C'mon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:45.51,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:47.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You mean you like her-pri.{she's ever so vaguely correcting aloma from Noroi to Noroke. Silly tsundere devil.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:49.99,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Our friendship is eternal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.05,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:51.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:54.67,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We also have a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Here's the other half of the drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.30,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.26,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,You found it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:07.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What we thought to be a really big butterfly actually turned out to be the drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.82,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hold on a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:09.47,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:13.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Then just what is this drawing that we picked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:19.19,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm not screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:22.12,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Everything's been patched up! {A perfect reconciliation. Harmony has been restored!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:24.91,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.91,0:15:27.99,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It looks like SoLaMi Smile took this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:34.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,T-Thanks, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The demon showed gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:40.44,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:41.66,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:42.63,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:47.10,Default,SoLaMi,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.06,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,It's finally here-nekon!{It's come}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:50.46,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:52.98,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You've formed a Dream Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:15:55.08,Default,All,0,0,0,,A Dream Team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:16:00.57,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,A new Dream Team has been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:04.89,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Everyone, please take the subway to the Dream Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.55,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:32.47,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Let's make our way to the Dream Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:33.68,Default,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:40.79,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Now then, please tell me your team name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:42.05,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Team name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:43.61,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We haven't discussed it yet-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:48.30,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,In accordance with the Aloma Prophecy,\Nour team name shall be Dream Alomagedon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh? But I like SoLaMagedon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:53.02,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,SoLaMagedon?! Hold up a sec-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.52,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,If we use that, my name wouldn't even be in it any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.71,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What do you think about "Mirelle with SoLaMagedon"-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:00.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,SoLaMagedon Mi is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.67,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:04.56,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,SoLaMagedon Mi... sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.14,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:10.72,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,All right, SoLaMagedon Mi, we've arrived at the Dream Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:13.74,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hold on, Mega-nii!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:20.86,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.28,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:27.24,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The Dream Team SoLaMagedon Mi has been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:36.90,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:45.64,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,As the party's guest of honour,\Na big cake fits Aloma-chan perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.47,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Lucky Surprise Birthday Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:49.94,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.52,0:17:54.97,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And to liven up PriPara's birthday party,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.98,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Poppin' Clown Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:59.81,Default,MiLa,0,0,0,,Exciting{Dokidoki} Surprise Party Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.15,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel! {Can we put "Ehe!" on Lala's side of the screen?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:08.32,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And to announce the beginning of the party, just like a party popper, a full party costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:11.07,Default,Miphy,0,0,0,,Smiling Surprise Party Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.29,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri. {Tehe! Same thing here}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:17.94,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:21.36,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:24.24,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for this! {It's finally starting}{?? TLC?  Can you make it out? mou suta... n da ne something}{it's just random crowd screaming, who cares. Just throw in some generic "do your best!" "I'm so happy"s}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:26.24,Default-Alt,Rand3,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.76,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:32.73,Default,SoLaMagedonMi,0,0,0,,Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:43.41,Default,SoLaMagedonMi,0,0,0,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.96,Default,SoLaMagedonMi,0,0,0,,Cyalume Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:52.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\pos(311.74,687)}Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.232,687)}Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:12.99,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma, happy birthday-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:17.25,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Today we celebrate my 660,012th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:23.82,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Exciting{Dokidoki} Birthday Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:33.42,Default,ALoMagedonMi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:36.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dream Theatre concerts are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:40.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This was the most exciting thing in all of the 660,012 years I've lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:41.89,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:43.85,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:45.53,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:46.81,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,But completely unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:51.78,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Girls, that was a wonderful surprise concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:53.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:58.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...the charm's light has faded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:20:59.55,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.46,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Once you've done your Dream Theatre Concert,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.54,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,the charm resets your team members.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:05.77,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.50,Default,All,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:13.28,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Since the system wants to see everyone's potential, you aren't bound to one team.{As the system wants to be able to see everyone's potential, you aren't bound to a team.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:14.46,Default,All,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:16.97,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,To be honest, I want to see it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I want to do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:21.81,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm doing it next!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:26.70,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm a little relieved that SoLaMagedon Mi got reset-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:31.36,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:33.25,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,That was a wonderful concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:07.48,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Neko-neesan-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:08.83,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,What-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.83,0:23:14.79,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,I have a super cute little sister who is the apple of my ear-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:18.42,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,I want to be a cool older brother to my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:18.89,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Won{\alpha&HFF&}derful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:19.36,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Wonder{\alpha&HFF&}ful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.36,0:23:19.80,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:22.09,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I could fall for you-nekon. {fancy timing thing there maybe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:23.26,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Really-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:26.05,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Your face is unseemly-nekon.{だらしない顔 - untidy / scruffy}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:28.31,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Where'd that cool older brother go-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:30.69,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:32.04,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,This Is My Little Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.37,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:34.81,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
